// The executable's icon (configured by CMakeLists.txt with the icon's
// absolute path). Named GLFW_ICON because that is the resource GLFW loads
// for every window's class -- the title bar and the taskbar -- and, as the
// executable's only icon, it is also the one Explorer and a shortcut show.
GLFW_ICON ICON "@LOBOLE_WINDOWS_ICON@"

// The application manifest (1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 =
// RT_MANIFEST): it makes UTF-8 the process's code page; lobole.manifest
// says why.
1 24 "@LOBOLE_WINDOWS_MANIFEST@"
